	(text "Connector notes:\n- J3 ENCODER (JST-PH 4): 1 SDA, 2 SCL, 3 GND, 4 +3V3 (matches the AS5600 board cable). Check the cable keeps pin 1 on pin 1.\n  R32/R33 are do-not-populate: the AS5600 board has its own pull-ups.\n- J4 MOTOR (JST-PH 3): phases A/B/C. Wire order only changes direction; firmware calibrates it.\n  Silkscreen: A B C / W R K.\n- J5 BREAKOUT (2x5): 1 +3V3, 2 GND, 3 IO36, 4 IO37, 5 IO38, 6 IO39, 7 IO40, 8 IO41, 9 TX0, 10 RX0.\n- H1-H4: M3 (3.2 mm) on a centred 24 mm square, not connected to GND."
		(at 180.34 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "efc39700-fc48-4dc1-9688-acd7909d21e2")
	)
